From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iwls <iwls@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:25:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Library: import programs from zip and 7z archives

The library's + is now a menu: Import archive (zip or 7z) or Choose a
program in drive_c. An archive picked in Files is unpacked by
MadeiraArchive.c into C:\Programs\<name> (an archive holding a single
folder becomes that folder), with progress and Cancel. When the archive
holds one obvious program it is added to the library at once; otherwise a
list of its executables, installers and uninstallers last, lets the user
choose, or browse the folder.
